**Refined Blueprint – Merge Insights into Workflow**

---

### 1. Confirmed Approach
- **Data source:** `LandingPage.php::getInsightGroups()` already returns the four insight groups keyed to the workflow stages (`request_approval`, `order_processing`, `procurement_payment`, `logistics`). No PHP changes required.  
- **View composition:**  
  - `workflow.blade.php` becomes the single container for the workflow stepper **and** all insight affordances (audio, video, text).  
  - Each step card receives a `group` attribute matching its insight key.  
  - Inline media buttons (▶️ Listen, ▶️ Watch, 📖 Read) are shown only when the corresponding media exists for that group.  
  - The text‑modal and video‑modal markup (formerly in `insights.blade.php`) are moved into `workflow.blade.php`.  
  - An auto‑rotating ticker (`.lp-ticker`) sits just above the footer, cycling a flattened list of all tips (accent‑dot + title) every 7 s, pausing on hover or when any modal/audio is active.  
- **Removals:**  
  - Delete `insights.blade.php`.  
  - Remove the Insights tab button from `header.blade.php` and its panel from `landing-page.blade.php`.  
  - Rename the Alpine JS file and adjust imports/initialisation accordingly.  
- **Styling:** Extend `landing-page.css` with `.lp-ticker` primitives that reuse existing `--custom-*` and `--google-*` tokens and `.lp-*` utility classes; no new animations or keyframes.  
- **Localization:** Add missing French keys (`insights_watch`, `insights_open_module`) and introduce workflow‑specific keys (`workflow_read`, `insights_tip_prefix`) for all three locales.

---

### 2. Edge Cases / Risks Found & Mitigations
| # | Issue | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|-------|--------|------------|
| **a** | **Missing insight group for a stage** (e.g., `getInsightGroups()` returns only 3 groups). | The step card would lack `group` data → media buttons would be hidden, modals would error on undefined `group`. | In `workflow.blade.php`, compute `$insightByGroup = collect($insightGroups ?? [])->keyBy('key');` then **guard** each button/modal with `@if(isset($insightByGroup[$step['key']]))`. If missing, render the card without media affordances and log a warning via `@php \Log::warning('Insight group missing for step '.$step['key']); @endphp`. |
| **b** | **lp-audio-play source‑id clash** after renaming from `insights` → `workflow`. | `triWidget` (which ignores events where `detail.source !== 'widget'`) continues to work, but any other listener that hard‑coded `source === 'insights'` would stop receiving audio events. | Search the codebase for `source === 'insights'` (or similar) and update to `source === 'workflow'`. The only known consumer is the Alpine `workflow` store itself (lp-audio-play listener). No other listeners exist; if any are found, rename them accordingly. |
| **c** | **Auto‑rotate pause semantics** – race between hover pause, modal open, and audio play. | Ticker could advance while a modal is open, causing visual inconsistency. | In the Alpine store, compute a boolean `isBlocked = textOpen || videoOpen || playing || paused;` and **skip** `nextTip()` when `isBlocked` is true. The interval still runs; the guard prevents index change. Hover sets `paused = true`; modal open sets `textOpen/videoOpen = true`; audio play sets `playing = true`. All reset on close/stop. |
| **d** | **Dangling references** after deleting `insights.blade.php` and removing the tab. | Blade includes, JS imports, or lang keys could still reference the removed file, causing errors. | - Remove the `@include('landing-page.includes.insights')` line from `landing-page.blade.php`.<br>- Delete the import `import insights from './insights-alpine'` in `alpine-loader.js` and replace with the workflow import.<br>- Verify via `grep -r "insights"` (excluding lang files) returns zero matches.<br>- Lang keys remain; they are harmless. |
| **e** | **Compact card overflow** – 2 link rows + 3 media buttons may exceed `.lp-surface` width on narrow screens. | UI breaks, horizontal scroll or wrapped buttons look ugly. | - Use Flexbox with `flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem;` on the media‑button container.<br>- Set button width to `max-content` and give them `.lp-btn--icon` (already token‑driven).<br>- Add a media query (`@media (max-width: 480px)`) that stacks the link rows vertically and reduces font‑size via existing `--lp-text-sm` token. <br>- Validate with visual regression on the MiniMax‑M3 viewport set. |
| **f** | **Token/CSS drift** – introducing new classes that duplicate or conflict with existing utilities. | Inconsistent styling, harder maintenance. | - All new styles (`lp-ticker`, `lp-ticker__dot`, `lp-ticker__label`, `lp-ticker__bar`) are added **only** to `landing-page.css` and built from existing tokens (`--custom-bg-surface`, `--custom-accent-*`, `--lp-border`, `--lp-transition-fast`).<br>- Avoid new keyframes; use Alpine `x-transition` for crossfade and CSS `transition` for the progress bar.<br>- Run `npm run lint:css` (stylelint) to confirm no unknown tokens. |

---

### 3. File‑by‑File Change Spec (Exact Signatures)

| File | Change | Exact Signature / Snippet (pseudo) |
